---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Hub 0: Historical Mythology | Sacred History"
  description="Uncover the structural roots of global esoteric traditions—from the Vedic architectures of non-dualism to the occult origins of the Tarot and the Monomyth."
>
  <main class="site-wrapper section theme-reconciling" style="padding-top: 40px;">
      
    <!-- WAYFINDING CONDUIT -->
    <nav class="shsq-wayfinding-conduit reveal" aria-label="Hub Navigation" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto 50px auto; padding: 0 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px;">
      <ul class="breadcrumb-trail" style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; gap: 10px; font-family: var(--font-display); text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.85rem;">
        <li><a href="/the-escape-matrix/">&#8629; Master Grid</a></li>
        <li class="separator" aria-hidden="true" style="color: var(--shsq-muted);">/</li>
        <li class="current-node" aria-current="page" style="color: var(--shsq-parchment);">Hub 0: Historical Mythology</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="adjacent-node">
        <a href="/gnostic-gnosis/" style="font-family: var(--font-display); text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 1px; border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor; padding-bottom: 2px;">Engage Hub I &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- HUB HERO -->
    <header class="shsq-hub-hero reveal" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 60px; max-width: 1200px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding: 0 20px;">
      <span class="archive-eyebrow" style="color: var(--shsq-silver); font-size: 0.95rem; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; display: block; margin-bottom: 15px;">Hub 0 &middot; The Exoteric Threshold</span>
      <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem); margin: 0 0 25px 0; line-height: 1.1;">Historical Mythology</h1>
      <p style="color: var(--shsq-parchment); font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.8; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
        Uncover the structural roots of global esoteric traditions—from the Vedic architectures of non-dualism to the occult origins of the Tarot and the psychological mechanics of the Monomyth. Engage with comparative mythology not as arbitrary folklore, but as a heavily codified, universal technology of human initiation, grounded entirely in primary-source verification.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- PILLAR CLUSTER GRID (6 NODES) -->
    <div class="shsq-cluster-grid reveal reveal-delay-1" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; margin-bottom: 80px; max-width: 1200px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding: 0 20px;">
        
      <!-- Pillar 1 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 1: Eastern Architecture</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">The Vedic &amp; Upanishadic Mechanics</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Examine the foundational texts of the East, deconstructing the early somatic and energy systems of the Vedas and the exploration of the Supreme Self within the Upanishads.
        </p>
        <a href="/historical-mythology/vedas-and-upanishads/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 2 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 2: The Illusion of Matter</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">The Egyptian &amp; Platonic Underworld</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Analyze the structural cartography of the afterlife in the Egyptian Book of the Dead alongside Plato’s Allegory of the Cave, exploring the mechanisms of escaping sensory captivity.
        </p>
        <a href="/historical-mythology/egyptian-platonic-underworld/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 3 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 3: The Synthesized Symbol</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">Ouspensky &amp; The Hermetic Tarot</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Deconstruct the Tarot de Marseille not as a divinatory game, but as an ultimate, visual synthesis of Hermetic and Qabalistic architecture, serving as a mechanical map of the macrocosm.
        </p>
        <a href="/historical-mythology/symbolism-of-the-tarot/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 4 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 4: The Stellar Cult</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">Astro-Theology &amp; Sidereal Myth</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Investigate the reclamation of the Stellar Cult, decoding how ancient civilizations utilized the precession of the equinoxes and the zodiac as a vast mythic and psychological clock.
        </p>
        <a href="/historical-mythology/astro-theology-stellar-cult/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 5 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 5: The Monomyth</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">The Hero's Journey as Ritual Mechanic</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Decode Joseph Campbell’s comparative mythology, proving that the universal narrative of the Hero with a Thousand Faces is an exact, empirical map for psychological initiation and transformation.
        </p>
        <a href="/historical-mythology/campbell-heros-journey/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 6 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 6: Eschatology</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">The Archaic Revival &amp; Timewave Zero</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Explore Terence McKenna’s radical synthesis of shamanic psychopharmacology, alchemy, and fractal time, culminating in the structural theory of a universal eschatological attractor.
        </p>
        <a href="/historical-mythology/mckenna-archaic-revival/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

    </div>

    <!-- TERMINAL PROMPT -->
    <aside class="shsq-terminal-prompt reveal" aria-labelledby="terminal-heading" style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 80px auto; text-align: center;">
      <h2 id="terminal-heading">The Gateway to Gnosis</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--shsq-parchment); font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 40px; max-width: 700px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
        Historical mythology is the exoteric threshold. Having mapped the macrocosmic myths and ancient initiatory frameworks, you are now prepared to cross into the inner sanctuary of direct, experiential knowledge.
      </p>
      <a href="/gnostic-gnosis/" class="btn btn-primary">
        Engage Hub I &#8599;
      </a>
    </aside>

    <!-- FOOTER NOTE -->
    <footer class="shsq-footer-note reveal reveal-delay-2" style="text-align: center; color: var(--shsq-silver); font-size: 0.85rem; font-style: italic; border-top: 1px solid rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.2); padding-top: 30px; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px;">
      <p style="margin: 0;">History SQ: Decoding the Enneagrammatic Escape Plan &middot; Guided by Sophia Mysterion.</p>
    </footer>

  </main>
</Layout>